Package: Obligato
Title: Doublet Composition Identification from Continuous Cell-Type Scores
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jiadong", "Mao", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "chiatungmao@gmail.com")
Description: Identifies the cell-type composition of doublets in single-cell RNA-seq
    data - which two cell types a doublet contains, not merely that a droplet is
    abnormal. Fits per-pair logit-normal models over PhiSpace continuous cell-type
    scores, treating within-lineage co-elevation as a baseline rather than as signal.
    Composition can be applied downstream of any doublet detector; a detector is also
    provided. The name is the anglicised variant of the musical 'obbligato', a part
    that cannot be omitted.
